            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "倒装疑问",
                "<bdi>Vient-il ?</bdi>",
                "主语代词与动词之间"
              ],
              [
                "肯定命令式 + 代词",
                "<bdi>Donne-le-moi.</bdi>",
                "代词之间也用连字符"
              ],
              [
                "复合词",
                "<bdi>grand-père</bdi>、<bdi>porte-monnaie</bdi>、<bdi>arc-en-ciel</bdi>",
                "固定复合词"
              ],
              [
                "数词",
                "<bdi>dix-sept</bdi>、<bdi>vingt et un</bdi>、<bdi>quatre-vingt-un</bdi>",
                "<bdi>et</bdi> 前后不加连字符"
              ],
              [
                "自反代词后置（命令式）",
                "<bdi>Lève-toi !</bdi>",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "「那里 / 这里」",
                "<bdi>là-bas</bdi>、<bdi>ici-là</bdi>",
                ""
              ]
            ],
            "lang": "fr"
          },
          {
            "caption": "不用连字符的情况",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "情况",
              "例"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "名词 + 形容词",
                "<bdi>une robe rouge</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "副词 + 形容词",
                "<bdi>très grand</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "动词 + 补语",
                "<bdi>il parle vite</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "数词 + <bdi>et + un</bdi>",
                "<bdi>vingt et un</bdi>"
              ]
            ],
            "lang": "fr"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "1990 年正字法改革建议把很多复合词用连字符连接（如 <bdi>porte-monnaie</bdi> 不变，但 <bdi>vingt-et-un</bdi> 一类写法仍有争议）；写作时以词典为准。"
      },
