  {
    "id": "fr-liaison",
    "title": "联诵与连音",
    "items": [
      {
        "id": "fr-liaison-rules",
        "title": "三类联诵",
        "tables": [
          {
            "caption": "联诵的三种情况",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "类别",
              "规则",
              "例"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "必须联诵",
                "限定词 + 名词、代词 + 动词、形容词 + 名词、单音节副词 / 介词 + 词、数词",
                "<bdi>les_amis</bdi>、<bdi>nous_avons</bdi>、<bdi>petit_enfant</bdi>、<bdi>très_important</bdi>、<bdi>deux_ans</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "禁止联诵",
                "<bdi>et</bdi> 之后、嘘音 h 开头的词、数字 <bdi>un</bdi> 与名词之间（部分用法）、词组间停顿处",
                "<bdi>et_#puis</bdi>、<bdi>les_#héros</bdi>、<bdi>un_#chat</bdi>（部分变体）"
              ],
              [
                "可选联诵",
                "名词 + 形容词、动词 + 补语、复数名词之间",
                "<bdi>des livres_(anciens)</bdi>、<bdi>ils parlent_(à moi)</bdi>"
              ]
            ],
            "lang": "fr"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "联诵是词尾<strong>不发音的辅音</strong>与后一词开头的元音连读；连音（<bdi>enchaînement</bdi>）是<strong>本来发音的辅音</strong>与后一词的元音连读（<bdi>elle_est</bdi>），不属于联诵、也不可省略。"
      },
      {
        "id": "fr-liaison-sounds",
        "title": "联诵音的读音变化",
        "tables": [
          {
            "caption": "音变",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "词尾字母",
              "联诵音",
              "例"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "<bdi>-s / -x</bdi>",
                "<bdi>[z]</bdi>",
                "<bdi>les amis [le-za-mi]</bdi>、<bdi>deux ans [dø-zɑ̃]</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>-d</bdi>",
                "<bdi>[t]</bdi>",
                "<bdi>grand homme [ɡʁɑ̃-tɔm]</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "<bdi>-f</bdi>",
                "<bdi>[v]</bdi>",
                "<bdi>neuf ans [nø-vɑ̃]</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "-<bdi>n / -m</bdi>（鼻化元音）",
                "去鼻化 + [<bdi>n</bdi>]",
                "<bdi>bon ami [bɔ-n‿a-mi]</bdi>、<bdi>un homme [œ̃-nɔm]</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "-t（在 <bdi>et</bdi> 以外）",
                "<bdi>[t]</bdi>",
                "<bdi>petit enfant [pə-ti-tɑ̃-fɑ̃]</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "-<bdi>r</bdi>（部分词）",
                "[ʁ]",
                "<bdi>premier étage [pʁə-mje-ʁe-taʒ]</bdi>"
              ]
            ],
            "lang": "fr"
          }
        ],
        "notes": "鼻化元音（<bdi>in / an / on</bdi>）在联诵时失去鼻化，后接 [n]：<bdi>un / œ̃/ → /œ-n</bdi>/。"
      },
      {
        "id": "fr-liaison-examples",
        "title": "常见必须联诵的组合",
